  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 180°C. Lightly grease a medium baking dish.",
    "Put the sliced apples, blueberries and raspberries into the dish. Add the sugar and lemon juice, then toss gently until coated.",
    "In a bowl, mix the plain flour, rolled oats, brown sugar, cinnamon and salt.",
    "Add the cold butter and rub it in with your fingertips until the mixture looks like coarse crumbs with some larger pieces.",
    "Scatter the crumble topping evenly over the fruit, without pressing it down.",
    "Bake for 30 to 35 minutes, until the top is golden and the fruit is bubbling at the edges. Leave to cool for a few minutes before serving."
